# 🔧 All Components

## Main Electronics

- Arduino Uno
- 1.8" ST7735 TFT LCD display (128×160)
- HC-SR04 ultrasonic distance sensor
- 2× SG90 9g servo motors

## Power

- External 5V power supply for the servo motors
- USB cable for Arduino Uno
- Jumper wires

## Prototyping

- Breadboard
- Male-to-male jumper wires
- Male-to-female jumper wires
- Female-to-female jumper wires

## Mechanical Parts

- 2-axis servo mounting/bracket
- Servo horns
- Screws for mounting the servos
- Robot/project chassis or mounting platform
- Sensor mounting bracket

## Optional Components

These are not required for the basic scanner, but can be added for future upgrades:

- Buzzer
- LEDs
- Push buttons
- HC-05 Bluetooth module
- MicroSD card module
- MicroSD card
- ESP32
- ESP32-CAM
- Camera mounting bracket

